/Title (The time freed up by AI is often fragmented: 10 minutes here, 5 minutes there. If employees use it to check their emails or polish secondary presentations, the business gains nothing. Worse, it has increased its spending on APIs and servers while its payroll has remained unchanged: automation has worsened its immediate cash position.)
